{"about_the_game":"<strong>There is a house</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467950/extras/35e21655cd84a0bc1e8878c6c2ebae67.avif?t=1768451059\" width=696 height=638 /></span><br><br><strong>In the house is a man.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467950/extras/40fb137c0b102db4822f2c7f8ccd9cd1.avif?t=1768451059\" width=696 height=716 /></span><br><br><strong>You must kill this man. But be careful, he is surrounded by guards.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467950/extras/f55ca97b86e97a9b1b160030625a68d5.avif?t=1768451059\" width=696 height=660 /></span><br><br><strong>After you kill the man, escape back to your car.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467950/extras/3a47e10206409ceba354f366d5d5199e.avif?t=1768451059\" width=696 height=674 /></span><br><br><strong>Successfully escape and you win.</strong><br><br>Kill the Man in the House is a short first-person shooter with a focus on sandbox combat and gore. Fight your way through a horde of enemies as you make your way to a house and kill the man inside. Combat features real-time dismemberment. Watch in slow-motion as body parts go flying. See the ground painted red with the carnage you wrought. Enjoy the fast-paced, visceral, and cartoonish violence.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><br>WASD to move<br><br>mouse to look<br><br>L-click - fire weapon<br><br>scroll wheel - cycle weapons<br><br>1 - select pistol<br><br>2 - select uzi<br><br>3 - select shotgun<br><br>CTRL - crouch<br><br>space - Jump (you can double and triple jump)<br><br>T - toggle flashlight<br><br>F - kick<br><br>R - spin revolver","bac